  "verbalization": "Certonardosterol D3 is consistently linked to SNB-78 through multiple pathways, all of which involve the target SNU-387. The evidence suggests that Certonardosterol D3 acts as a target for several compounds, including SNU-387, 5-Hydroxy-6,8-Dimethoxy-2,3-Dimethylbenzo[G]Chromen-4-One, and Anolobine, which in turn target SNB-78. This indicates a potential mechanism where Certonardosterol D3 may influence SNB-78 through the activation or inhibition of a common target, SNU-387. The presence of multiple distinct compounds sharing the same target suggests that the relationship between Certonardosterol D3 and SNB-78 may involve a broader biological process, possibly involving the modulation of a specific molecular pathway or cellular function. The evidence supports a mechanistic link, but further investigation is needed to determine the exact nature of the interaction and its relevance to therapeutic applications.",
